      div(flex-grow w-full bg-white rounded-lg p2 flex-cc flex-col gap-6)
        div(flex w-full)
          img(src="images/ezequiel-humano/sm.webp" h-100 rounded-2)
          div(flex-cc uppercase font-mono text-center w-full grow text-30) Hey 
        div(flex-cc w-full)
          div(flex-cc text-center w-full flex-col)
            | My name is Ezequiel Adrián Schwartzman
            div I'm an open source commons developer working on Gaia's Team
            div
              | I'm creating the Web Jam Editor
